{
 "Q-CityGetBuildingsGetBuildingsAtLocation": {
  "id": "Q-CityGetBuildingsGetBuildingsAtLocation",
  "type": "QUERY",
  "table": "City",
  "functionA": "GetBuildings",
  "invoke": "Colon (Instance)",
  "availability": "UI",
  "functionB": "GetBuildingsAtLocation",
  "displayName": "City:GetBuildings():GetBuildingsAtLocation()",
  "notes": [
   "[作用] 返回指定单元格上属于该城市的所有建筑类型索引数组",
   "返回的建筑类型索引可用作 GameInfo.Buildings 的键",
   "只能获取已建成的建筑，未建成的建筑可以使用 GetConstructionsAtLocation"
  ],
  "functionC": ""
 },
 "A-CityGetBuildQueueAddProgress": {
  "id": "A-CityGetBuildQueueAddProgress",
  "type": "ACTION",
  "table": "City",
  "functionA": "GetBuildQueue",
  "invoke": "Colon (Instance)",
  "availability": "GamePlay",
  "functionB": "AddProgress",
  "displayName": "City:GetBuildQueue():AddProgress()",
  "notes": [
   "[作用] 为城市当前生产项增加一定数量的生产力进度",
   "GetBuildQueue() 可能返回 nil，调用前需要判空",
   "[注意] 如果生产项有增产/减产效果，amount 的值也会被相应增加/减少。例如，如果生产开拓者时 +50% 生产力，AddProgress(100) 会增加 150 点生产进度；如果生产开拓者时 -50% 生产力，AddProgress(100) 只会增加 50 点生产进度",
   "amount 的值可以为负数，此时会降低生产进度，甚至可以将生产进度降低至负数（此时需要更多生产力才能完成生产）"
  ]
 },
 "Q-CityGetBuildQueueCurrentlyBuilding": {
  "id": "Q-CityGetBuildQueueCurrentlyBuilding",
  "type": "QUERY",
  "table": "City",
  "functionA": "GetBuildQueue",
  "invoke": "Colon (Instance)",
  "availability": "GamePlay",
  "functionB": "CurrentlyBuilding",
  "displayName": "City:GetBuildQueue():CurrentlyBuilding()",
  "notes": [
   "[作用] 获取城市当前正在建造的内容的类型 ID",
   "返回值可用于索引 GameInfo.Buildings、GameInfo.Districts、GameInfo.Units、GameInfo.Projects 等配置表",
   "城市没有生产任务时返回 \"NONE\""
  ]
 },
 "A-CityGetBuildQueueFinishProgress": {
  "id": "A-CityGetBuildQueueFinishProgress",
  "type": "ACTION",
  "table": "City",
  "functionA": "GetBuildQueue",
  "invoke": "Colon (Instance)",
  "availability": "GamePlay",
  "functionB": "FinishProgress",
  "displayName": "City:GetBuildQueue():FinishProgress()",
  "notes": [
   "[作用] 试图完成城市当前正在建造的项目",
   "[注意] FinishProgress 有时无法真正完成生产。如果生产项有减产效果，FinishProgress 只会推进生产项的部分生产进度。例如，如果生产开拓者时 -50% 生产力，且开拓者剩余成本是 100，FinishProgress 最终只会增加 50 点生产进度，不会完成生产。详情可查看 AddProgress 函数"
  ]
 },
 "Q-CityGetBuildQueueGetConstructionsAtLocation": {
  "id": "Q-CityGetBuildQueueGetConstructionsAtLocation",
  "type": "QUERY",
  "table": "City",
  "functionA": "GetBuildQueue",
  "invoke": "Colon (Instance)",
  "availability": "UI",
  "functionB": "GetConstructionsAtLocation",
  "displayName": "City:GetBuildQueue():GetConstructionsAtLocation()",
  "notes": [
   "[作用] 查询城市在指定单元格上的建造队列中的建筑类型索引数组",
   "GetBuildQueue() 可能返回 nil，调用前需判空",
   "返回值为 table，每个元素是建筑类型索引（number），可用于 GameInfo.Buildings[] 查找",
   "只能获取尚未建成的建筑，获取已建成建筑可使用 GetBuildingsAtLocation"
  ],
  "functionC": ""
 },
 "Q-CityGetBuildQueueGetTurnsLeft": {
  "id": "Q-CityGetBuildQueueGetTurnsLeft",
  "type": "QUERY",
  "table": "City",
  "functionA": "GetBuildQueue",
  "invoke": "Colon (Instance)",
  "availability": "UI",
  "functionB": "GetTurnsLeft",
  "displayName": "City:GetBuildQueue():GetTurnsLeft()",
  "notes": [
   "[作用] 获取城市建造队列中生产项目的剩余回合数",
   "无参数调用时返回当前正在生产的项目剩余回合",
   "传入生产项目类型时可查询特定项目的剩余回合",
   "单位生产时可通过第二个参数指定军事编队类型"
  ],
  "functionC": ""
 },
 "Q-CityGetDistrictsGetDistrict": {
