 "A-UIRequestPlayerOperation": {
  "id": "A-UIRequestPlayerOperation",
  "type": "ACTION",
  "table": "UI",
  "functionA": "RequestPlayerOperation",
  "invoke": "Dot (Global)",
  "availability": "UI",
  "displayName": "UI.RequestPlayerOperation()",
  "notes": [
   "[作用] UI 向 Gameplay 发送操作请求",
   "无返回值，通过参数表传递操作所需的全部数据",
   "常用操作类型：EXECUTE_SCRIPT（执行自定义Lua脚本）、BRIBE_CLAN/HIRE_CLAN/RANSOM_CLAN/INCITE_CLAN（蛮族部落）、APPOINT_GOVERNOR/ASSIGN_GOVERNOR/PROMOTE_GOVERNOR（总督）、ACCEPT_EMERGENCY/REJECT_EMERGENCY（紧急事件）、COMMEMORATE（纪念）、UNLOCK_POLICIES（解锁政策）、START_OBSERVER_MODE（观察者模式）",
   "参数表的key是 PlayerOperations 常量，如 PARAM_PLOT_ONE、PARAM_OTHER_PLAYER、PARAM_GOVERNOR_TYPE 等",
   "发送操作请求的玩家（orderPlayerID）和实际执行操作的玩家可以不同：通过 parameters 传递一个或多个实际执行操作的玩家 ID。操作将在 orderPlayerID 玩家的回合内执行"
  ],
  "functionB": "",
  "functionC": ""
 }
}